"""
first_rehab_qa_training.py
Q&A knowledge base for training an AI agent for First Rehabilitation of North Palm Beach.

HOW IT WORKS
  1. BUSINESS FACTS are stored once as variables.
  2. Each answer is an f-string that pulls from those variables, so changing a
     fact (phone, hours, etc.) updates every answer automatically.
  3. QA_ITEMS is a list of QAItem objects: topic, question, answer, keywords.
  4. export_json() / export_html_ready() produce clean data your developer can
     turn into HTML (accordion FAQ, schema.org FAQPage markup, chatbot training set).

ITEMS MARKED "TODO" ARE PLACEHOLDERS: fill in real values before going live.
Any item with needs_review=True should be confirmed by Nick before publishing.
"""

